%% FR lifecycle spine. Composite substates are shown as simple states here and
%% expanded in the derived views.
%% Derived views: workspace-fr-flow-todo-coordination.mmd (TODO runtime + FR child coordination),
%%   workspace-fr-flow-review-and-recycle.mmd (parent-join gate + recycled-light / bounded-fix rework).
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> TRIAGED: Tyler opens FR
    TRIAGED --> BRANCHED: approval event + criteria, or exempt
    BRANCHED --> COMPLEXITY_ASSESSED: try one draft PR per affected repository; record permission denial and continue locally
    COMPLEXITY_ASSESSED --> MCP_FIRST: deterministic MCP-first invocation
    MCP_FIRST --> IN_PROGRESS: governed coordination MCP available
    MCP_FIRST --> LOCAL_FALLBACK: MCP unavailable
    LOCAL_FALLBACK --> IN_PROGRESS: canonical local utilities only

    note right of TRIAGED
        Classify observable effect before scope approval.
        Behavior-changing FRs draft Given/When/Then scenarios
        before Tyler approves scope. Documentation, housekeeping,
        and behavior-neutral refactors are exempt. After approval,
        record a typed SCOPE_APPROVED: decision. Persist approved
        scenarios here only when behavior changes.
    end note

    state "Bounded TODO operational runtime" as TODO_RUNTIME
    state "FR implementation anchor · child TODO coordination" as FR_COORDINATION
    state "Evidence-backed parent join gate" as PARENT_JOIN_EVALUATION
    state "Repository-aware child snapshots" as REPOSITORY_CHILD_SNAPSHOTS
    state "Trusted repository branch/head resolution" as REPOSITORY_HEAD_RESOLUTION
    state "Recompute against current repository heads" as CURRENT_HEAD_RECOMPUTE
    state "Diagram remediation" as DIAGRAM_REMEDIATION
    state "Per-repository PR checks and cost gates" as COST_GATE
    IN_PROGRESS --> TODO_RUNTIME: operational TODO execution
    TODO_RUNTIME --> IN_PROGRESS: required children, artifacts, current parent head validated
    IN_PROGRESS --> FR_COORDINATION: FR anchor admits executable TODO 333
    FR_COORDINATION --> IN_PROGRESS: child handoff complete
    IN_PROGRESS --> PARENT_JOIN_EVALUATION: implementation done
    PARENT_JOIN_EVALUATION --> REPOSITORY_CHILD_SNAPSHOTS: load child snapshots
    REPOSITORY_CHILD_SNAPSHOTS --> REPOSITORY_HEAD_RESOLUTION: repository/project identity required
    REPOSITORY_HEAD_RESOLUTION --> CURRENT_HEAD_RECOMPUTE: resolve each declared repository
    REPOSITORY_HEAD_RESOLUTION --> IN_PROGRESS: missing, stale, or mismatched repository contract
    CURRENT_HEAD_RECOMPUTE --> PARENT_JOIN_EVALUATION: single-repo compatibility uses parent branch/head
    CURRENT_HEAD_RECOMPUTE --> FUNCTIONAL_QA: PARENT_JOIN:PASS accepted
    CURRENT_HEAD_RECOMPUTE --> IN_PROGRESS: PARENT_JOIN:PASS blocked
    FUNCTIONAL_QA --> ARCHITECTURE_REVIEW: QA PASS
    FUNCTIONAL_QA --> IN_PROGRESS: QA FAIL / CHANGES_REQUESTED
    ARCHITECTURE_REVIEW --> DIAGRAM_REMEDIATION: STALE/MISSING → reject
    DIAGRAM_REMEDIATION --> ARCHITECTURE_REVIEW: beautifier updates → re-verify
    ARCHITECTURE_REVIEW --> REVIEW_REQUESTED: PASS / PASS_WITH_UPDATES, PR exists
    REVIEW_REQUESTED --> AUTO_REVIEWED: ⊕workspace-reviewer
    AUTO_REVIEWED --> COST_GATE: complete linked PR set has review evidence and green checks
    COST_GATE --> COST_ESTIMATED: every repository has an estimate
    COST_GATE --> COST_UNAVAILABLE: each unavailable outcome has per-repository reason/source
    COST_GATE --> MERGE_BLOCKED: any repository check fails or cost is NULL or pending
    COST_ESTIMATED --> TYLER_APPROVED: one final approval for the complete reviewed linked PR set
    COST_UNAVAILABLE --> TYLER_APPROVED: one final approval for the complete reviewed linked PR set
    TYLER_APPROVED --> MERGED: merge linked PRs, no second approval
    MERGE_BLOCKED --> COST_GATE: record each repository outcome
    MERGED --> SOAKING: post-merge soak window
    SOAKING --> SIGNED_OFF: signoff verified
    SIGNED_OFF --> [*]

    note right of ARCHITECTURE_REVIEW
        If draft PR creation is denied, continue local tests, QA,
        architecture review, and local review; record the blocker.
        Do not claim GitHub review or remote CI without an existing PR.
        Final approval waits for every linked PR and review evidence.
    end note

    note right of FUNCTIONAL_QA
        Parent-join evidence is required before
        TYLER_APPROVED, MERGED, SOAKING, and SIGNED_OFF.
        Technical progression through FUNCTIONAL_QA,
        ARCHITECTURE_REVIEW, REVIEW_REQUESTED, and
        AUTO_REVIEWED remains available while child
        TODO bookkeeping is incomplete. Child snapshots identify
        repository and project. Each declared repository resolves
        a trusted branch/head, then evidence is recomputed against
        current heads. Missing, stale, or mismatched contracts fail
        closed. Single-repo inputs retain the parent branch/head path.
        Recompute accepts PARENT_JOIN:PASS only with fresh valid evidence.
        Before FUNCTIONAL_QA, normal pytest and CI discover and pass all
        executable feature scenarios for behavior-changing FRs.
        Documentation, housekeeping, and behavior-neutral refactors
        are exempt from the BDD scenario gate.
        Recycled-light and bounded-fix rework paths are
        detailed in workspace-fr-flow-review-and-recycle.mmd.
    end note

    class MCP_FIRST,LOCAL_FALLBACK,DIAGRAM_REMEDIATION state

